00:01:06.405 --> 00:01:10.365
And once that opens a blank
workbook, you can see the main page.

00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:15.585
So very similar to Word, PowerPoint
all of your toolbars are along the top,

00:01:16.155 --> 00:01:19.815
