00:01:43.395 --> 00:01:47.325
The reason for this is that
Excel uses cell referencing to

00:01:47.325 --> 00:01:49.725
carry out functions and tasks.

00:01:49.755 --> 00:01:54.075
So if you have information in a
specific cell, that is how Excel will

00:01:54.085 --> 00:01:57.765
