the output in that cell.

00:02:16.935 --> 00:02:20.465
In addition to that, Excel also
structures information in worksheets.

00:02:20.924 --> 00:02:26.025
And the first one is sheet 1 which is the
very first sheet that opens by default.

00:02:26.505 --> 00:02:30.155
